        "fun": "Rattata's fangs never stop growing, so it has to gnaw on hard things to keep them short, and a Trainer who forgets to give it something to chew may lose a door frame or two. It breeds so fast that a pair can quickly take over an area: see one and there are likely more than 40 around. Its biggest fan is Youngster Joey, who insists his Rattata is the best there is.",
